{"unit_id":"tag:08G5:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。设 <MATH_0002> 为复形（complex），由 <MATH_0003>-模（modules）组成。称 <MATH_0004> 为 <TEXTITOPEN_0001>完美（perfect）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>的，若对每个对象（object）<MATH_0005>，属于 <MATH_0006>，都存在覆盖（covering）<MATH_0007>，使对每个 <MATH_0008>，存在复形（complexes）的态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0009>，\n它是拟同构（quasi-isomorphism），且 <MATH_0010> 严格（strictly）完美（perfect）。对象（object）<MATH_0011>，属于 <MATH_0012>，是 <TEXTITOPEN_0002>完美（perfect）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>的，若它可由完美复形（perfect complex）表示，其中各项为 <MATH_0013>-模（modules）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"perfect","target_term":"完美"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"strictly","target_term":"严格"},{"source_term":"perfect","target_term":"完美"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"perfect","target_term":"完美"},{"source_term":"perfect complex","target_term":"完美复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"系数位点"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"定义输入"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"复形系数"},{"source_term":"perfect","target_term":"完美","context":"复形与导出对象的定义"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"局部化与导出对象"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"严格完美的局部表示"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"局部拟同构"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"局部比较"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构","context":"局部等价"},{"source_term":"strictly","target_term":"严格","context":"修饰完美"},{"source_term":"perfect complex","target_ter